    "media:imagetext": "ONLY\nTWA\nTWO\nFEB REGE ENE FUGIT BONES PROGRAM\nTWA\n1234 567 89\nона P/54\nMR. WILLIAM POLL\nROYAL AMBASSADOR\nNEW\n1234 567 89\nVALID THRU 2/94\nMR. WILLIAM POLL\nCOMRAADOR\nCOMFORT\nLEVELS\nTWA announces\ntwo new elite levels of\nFFB® Join the TWA Frequent Flight Bonus\nProgram. You'll fly in comfort, with\nmembership. up to 50% more legroom than any\nother major U.S. airline. Every mile\nyou fly on TWA can count toward\nfree travel worldwide. And the miles\nyou earn have no expiration date.\nWhat's more, when you fly just\n20,000 actual miles on TWA or\nTW Express® (or four transatlantic\nsegments) within 12 months, you'll\nmove up one level to the TWA\nGold Ambassador® card. It entitles\nyou to upgrades on many fares and\nextra bonus miles. At 40,000\nictual miles on TWA or TW Expres\nor eignt transatlantic segments\nwithin 12 months, you'll qualify for\nthe ultimate privilege — the FFB\nRoyal Ambassador® card, with an\neven more generous upgrade policy\nand additional bonus miles:\nTo enroll in the FFB Program, call\nTWA toll-free at (800) 221-2000 in\nthe United States. Outside the U.S.,\ncall your local TWA office.\n*Upgrades are subject to availability.\nPurchase of a qualifying ticket is required.\nTWA The most comfortable way to hi",
